             "dung powder, a rubricated section 'Volgen noch mehr andere mittel' (belly plaster of ruddle, bloodstone, "
             "stag's heart-bone, bole; almond milk, tormentil water, unicorn horn, hartshorn, Diascordium martiale, "
             "laudanum opiatum, fresh horse dung juice), a rubricated section 'Volgente Lattwerung Ist ach gar gutt' "
             "(conserve of roses, plantain seed, red coral, dragon's blood, Armenian bole, oak bark, burnt blood "
             'powder, frankincense steam, coriander seed regimen, yarrow, burnt rhubarb), and a rubricated section '
             "'Köstliche Morsellen in disen Zustand' (morsels of Armenian bole, sealed earth, dragon's blood, cassia "
             'lignea, diatubith cum rhabarbaro, and mint water).',
